      "name": "Load Draft"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a LinkedIn content editor (NOT creator).\n\nBy strictly following users edit instructions:\n{{ $('Inbound Edit Req').item.json.edit_instruction }}\n\nRewrite a LinkedIn post:\n{{ $json.post_content }}\n\n{{ $json.narrative ? '\\nObey narrative context: ' + $json.narrative : '' }}\n\nKeep existing fixed structure.\nDo NOT label the sections explicitly (no headings like \"Intro\" or \"Rationale\"),\nbut each section MUST be clearly separated by a new paragraph.\n\nSTRUCTURE TO FOLLOW (IN ORDER):\n\n1) Topic / Title idea  \n- One short, punchy sentence.\n- Can be provocative or insight-driven.\n- This is the first line of the post.\n\n2) What happened (use case / symptom)  \n- Describe a concrete real-world situation.\n- Focus on how the problem manifested.\n- Make it feel like a production or testing incident.\n\n3) Why it happened (root cause / rationale)  \n- Explain the technical cause.\n- Connect symptoms to underlying system behavior.\n- Avoid solutions in this section.\n\n4) Resolution and prevention  \n- Describe fixes, mitigations, or design lessons.\n- End with a strong takeaway relevant to senior engineers.\n\nSTYLE RULES:\n- Write as one coherent post, not bullet points.\n- Start directly with the first sentence (no preamble).\n- Do NOT use prefixes like \"Hook:\".\n- Keep it concise, technical, and authoritative.\n- Audience: senior embedded engineers, tech leads, reviewers.\n- Structure = paragraphs\n\nCreate STRICT JSON only (no markdown, no commentary, no extra keys).\nOutput must be valid JSON.\n\nRules:\n- topic: 1 punchy sentence; no cause, no solution.\n- what_happened: describe the real-world symptom + context; no root cause, no fixes.\n- why_it_happened: technical root cause; no fixes.\n- solution_and_takeaway: fixes + prevention + final takeaway; do not introduce new symptoms.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
      "id": "3e57f5f3-c7e9-4ea8-97ed-2d5084d857ed",
      "name": "Rewrite Post JSON",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "position": [
        304,
        -240
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "alwaysOutputData": false,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
